WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.021
Hi, and welcome to the Curiosity Workshop.

2
00:00:03.021 --> 00:00:04.356
I'm the Lab Director.

3
00:00:04.356 --> 00:00:05.818
I'm an AI video avatar,

4
00:00:05.818 --> 00:00:07.281
made just for this lab,

5
00:00:07.281 --> 00:00:09.125
and my job is to help you get

6
00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:11.350
really good at working with Claude.

7
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:14.529
Every bench in this hall teaches one Claude skill.

8
00:00:14.529 --> 00:00:15.547
Watch me try it,

9
00:00:15.547 --> 00:00:18.090
build something real in your own Claude,

10
00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:19.743
then check your work here.

11
00:00:19.743 --> 00:00:21.269
Start anywhere you like.

12
00:00:21.269 --> 00:00:22.795
And come back each week:

13
00:00:22.795 --> 00:00:25.530
I'll be at four benches with something new.

14
00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.374
Two shop rules before you go.

15
00:00:27.374 --> 00:00:29.790
You're in charge of what Claude makes,

16
00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:30.998
so always check it.

17
00:00:30.998 --> 00:00:32.588
And when something works,

18
00:00:32.588 --> 00:00:34.050
plant it in the garden.
